2026-02-10 11:40:51,944 - DocumentGraderNode - INFO: Retrieved document What Is the International Capital Asset Pricing Model (ICAPM)?

The international capital asset pricing model (ICAPM) is a financial model that applies the traditional CAPM principle to international investments. It extends CAPM by considering the direct and indirect exposure to foreign currency in addition to time value and market risk included in the CAPM. is relevant
